  "Which hardware does SoifGo support?": "Quale hardware supporta SoifGo?",
  "Any device using Bluetooth SPP (HC-05, HC-06), MQTT, or HTTP REST APIs. This includes Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, Raspberry Pi, and more.": "Qualsiasi dispositivo che utilizzi Bluetooth SPP (HC-05, HC-06), MQTT o API HTTP REST. Questo include Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, Raspberry Pi e altro.",
  "What can I actually do inside the WebView?": "Cosa posso fare effettivamente dentro il WebView?",
